url: "https://qcg.securedme.ca/"
abstract: >-
  WebMCP-QCG is a browser-native, human-in-the-loop quantum preflight
  workbench. It inspects bounded experiment evidence, returns one of five
  deterministic recommendations, records explicit human decisions, supports
  bounded local Q# and OpenQASM Bell-fixture simulation, and exports
  reproducible evidence receipts without submitting a QPU or provider job.
